claim = success establishes that DOWN moves accessibility focus to the next direct ONE_OF_OPTION sibling, resolves that sibling live HII label, and speaks that focused label over native HDA while leaving the firmware current value unchanged
claim = success does not establish physical ASUS keyboard/audio behavior or reverse navigation
